## 4. Radio Counterpart Searches

We searched for radio pulsations from the new gamma-ray pulsars with the Effelsberg and Parkes Telescopes. PSRs J0554+3107 and J1932+1916 were observed with the Effelsberg Telescope at 1.4 GHz for 1 hr, using the new Ultra Broad Band (UBB) receiver (R. Keller et al. 2013, in prepara

